134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 86 0 R
/T (As electricity demand continues to grow, peak demand periods place significant stress on the power grid. During these hours, electricity consumption can approach or exceed available supply, causing transmission lines, transformers, and substations to operate near their limits. If this stress is not managed effectively, equipment may overheat, relays would trip, and localized failures can cascade across the network, potentially resulting in large-scale blackouts.)
/E (As electricity demand continues to grow, peak demand periods place significant stress on the power grid. During these hours, electricity consumption can approach or exceed available supply, causing transmission lines, transformers, and substations to operate near their limits. If this stress is not managed effectively, equipment may overheat, relays would trip, and localized failures can cascade across the network, potentially resulting in large-scale blackouts.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 86 0 R
/T (Gridantaw aims to address this by connecting residential communities with demand response programs. During peak-demand events, residents receive timely alerts and personalized recommendations on which flexible loads can be shifted or reduced with minimal impact on comfort. The platform also provides clear estimates of potential cost savings thereby enabling informed participation while helping reduce stress on the grid.)
/E (Gridantaw aims to address this by connecting residential communities with demand response programs. During peak-demand events, residents receive timely alerts and personalized recommendations on which flexible loads can be shifted or reduced with minimal impact on comfort. The platform also provides clear estimates of potential cost savings thereby enabling informed participation while helping reduce stress on the grid.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [12]
>>
