/Title (Gridantaw aims to address this by connecting residential communities with demand response programs. During peak-demand events, residents receive timely alerts and personalized recommendations on which flexible loads can be shifted or reduced with minimal impact on comfort. The platform also provides clear estimates of potential cost savings thereby enabling informed participation while helping reduce stress on the grid.)
